          </li>
          <li>
            Requirements analysis, exploring and following up on relevant marketing
            tools and expansion or iteration of existing information system functions
            based on business needs.
          </li>
          <li>
            Server operations and maintenance, deploying projects online, estimating
            resource usage based on actual project needs and expected visitor traffic
            to achieve cost control.
          </li>
          <li>
            Filing and compliance, completing project filing and technical compliance
            processing according to project functions and relevant regulatory requirements.
          </li>
          <li>
            Search engine optimization (SEO & GEO), improving the probability of
            project information being displayed and cited, enhancing exposure.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="project-entry">
        <div class="entry-header">
          <span class="project-name"
            >Shanghai Lingang Jinghong Security Technology Development Co., Ltd. Website System</span
          >
          <span class="entry-date">Jul 2025 - Sep 2025</span>
        </div>
        <div class="project-meta">
          Independently designed and delivered an AI-enhanced business system · Full-stack Development, AI Integration, UX/UI Design · Results: <a
            href="https://www.lingangjh.com"
            target="_blank">www.lingangjh.com</a
          >
        </div>
        <ul class="project-points">
          <li>
            Full-stack development of responsive official website and CMS backend
            based on Next.js, with localized deployment of LLM-powered intelligent
            Q&A assistant (Weknora) for enterprise knowledge base AI interaction.
          </li>
          <li>
            Designed database models using Prisma, configured multi-layer security
            with JWT, RLS, and CSP.
          </li>
          <li>
